<!DOCTYPE html> <html lang="sw"> <head> <meta charset="UTF-8"> <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"> <title>DigiPesa Credit Limited (DCL) — Mikopo ya Haraka, Inayoeleweka</title> <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"> <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin> <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,400;9..144,500;9..144,600;9..144,700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"> <style> :root{ --teal-950:#0A2E2A; --teal-900:#0E3B36; --teal-800:#154A43; --gold:#C9971C; --gold-light:#E4BA57; --sage:#7C9885; --paper:#F2EDE1; --paper-2:#EAE3D3; --ink:#1B2420; --ink-soft:#445048; --white:#FFFFFF; --line: rgba(27,36,32,0.15); } {box-sizing:border-box; margin:0; padding:0;} html{scroll-behavior:smooth;} body{ background:var(--paper); color:var(--ink); font-family:'Inter', sans-serif; line-height:1.6; -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased; } @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){ html{scroll-behavior:auto;} *{animation:none !important; transition:none !important;} } h1,h2,h3,h4{font-family:'Fraunces', serif; font-weight:600; color:var(--teal-950); line-height:1.15;} .mono{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;} a{color:inherit; text-decoration:none;} img{max-width:100%; display:block;} .wrap{max-width:1120px; margin:0 auto; padding:0 28px;} .eyebrow{ font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size:12.5px; letter-spacing:.14em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--gold); font-weight:600; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; } .eyebrow::before{content:""; width:22px; height:1px; background:var(--gold);} / ===== Skip link / focus ===== / .skip-link{position:absolute; left:-999px; top:0; background:var(--teal-950); color:var(--white); padding:12px 18px; z-index:999;} .skip-link:focus{left:12px; top:12px;} a:focus-visible, button:focus-visible, summary:focus-visible{ outline:2px solid var(--gold); outline-offset:3px; } / ===== Header ===== / header{ position:sticky; top:0; z-index:100; background:rgba(242,237,225,0.92); backdrop-filter:blur(8px); border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); } .nav{display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; padding:18px 28px;} .brand{display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; font-family:'Fraunces', serif; font-weight:700; font-size:19px; color:var(--teal-950);} .brand .mark{ width:34px; height:34px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--teal-950); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; color:var(--gold-light); font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-weight:600; font-size:14px; flex-shrink:0; } .brand .sub{display:block; font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size:10px; letter-spacing:.08em; color:var(--ink-soft); font-weight:400; text-transform:uppercase;} nav.links{display:flex; gap:30px; font-size:14.5px; font-weight:500;} nav.links a{position:relative; padding:4px 0; color:var(--ink);} nav.links a::after{content:""; position:absolute; left:0; bottom:-2px; width:0; height:1.5px; background:var(--gold); transition:width .25s ease;} nav.links a:hover::after{width:100%;} .nav-cta{ background:var(--teal-950); color:var(--white); padding:10px 20px; border-radius:2px; font-size:14px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:.01em; } .nav-cta:hover{background:var(--teal-800);} .menu-btn{display:none; background:none; border:none; cursor:pointer; padding:8px;} .menu-btn span, .menu-btn span::before, .menu-btn span::after{ display:block; width:22px; height:2px; background:var(--teal-950); position:relative; transition:.2s; } .menu-btn span::before{content:""; position:absolute; top:-7px;} .menu-btn span::after{content:""; position:absolute; top:7px;} @media (max-width:860px){ nav.links{ position:fixed; top:70px; left:0; right:0; bottom:0; background:var(--paper); flex-direction:column; gap:0; padding:10px 28px 40px; transform:translateY(-110%); transition:transform .3s ease; overflow-y:auto; } nav.links.open{transform:translateY(0);} nav.links a{padding:16px 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); font-size:17px;} .nav-cta{display:inline-block; margin-top:20px;} .menu-btn{display:block;} } / ===== Hero ===== / .hero{ background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 80% -10%, rgba(201,151,28,0.25), transparent 55%), linear-gradient(180deg, var(--teal-950), var(--teal-900)); color:var(--white); padding:90px 0 110px; position:relative; overflow:hidden; } .hero::after{ content:""; position:absolute; inset:0; background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.035) 0 1px, transparent 1px 90px); pointer-events:none; } .hero-inner{display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.15fr .85fr; gap:60px; align-items:center; position:relative;} @media (max-width:900px){.hero-inner{grid-template-columns:1fr;}} .hero .eyebrow{color:var(--gold-light);} .hero .eyebrow::before{background:var(--gold-light);} .hero h1{ color:var(--white); font-size:clamp(34px, 5vw, 54px); margin:18px 0 22px; max-width:15ch; } .hero h1 em{font-style:normal; color:var(--gold-light);} .hero p.lead{font-size:17px; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.82); max-width:46ch; margin-bottom:32px;} .btn-row{display:flex; gap:16px; flex-wrap:wrap;} .btn{ display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; padding:14px 26px; font-weight:600; font-size:15px; border-radius:2px; border:1px solid transparent; cursor:pointer; } .btn-primary{background:var(--gold); color:var(--teal-950);} .btn-primary:hover{background:var(--gold-light);} .btn-ghost{border-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.4); color:var(--white);} .btn-ghost:hover{border-color:var(--white); background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);} / passbook stamp / seal in hero / .seal{ width:190px; height:190px; border-radius:50%; border:1.5px dashed rgba(228,186,87,0.55); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; margin:0 auto; position:relative; } .seal-inner{ width:150px; height:150px; border-radius:50%; border:1px solid rgba(228,186,87,0.75); display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; text-align:center; gap:4px; transform:rotate(-8deg); } .seal-inner .mono{color:var(--gold-light); font-size:11px; letter-spacing:.12em; text-transform:uppercase;} .seal-inner strong{font-family:'Fraunces',serif; color:var(--white); font-size:20px;} / ===== Ledger strip (stat bar) ===== / .ledger-strip{ background:var(--teal-900); border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12); } .ledger-strip .wrap{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr); padding:26px 28px; } @media (max-width:760px){.ledger-strip .wrap{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr); gap:22px 0;}} .ledger-item{border-left:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15); padding-left:18px;} .ledger-item:first-child{border-left:none; padding-left:0;} .ledger-item .num{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; color:var(--gold-light); font-size:22px; font-weight:600;} .ledger-item .label{font-size:12.5px; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7); margin-top:4px;} / ===== Sections generic ===== / section{padding:88px 0;} .section-head{max-width:640px; margin-bottom:48px;} .section-head h2{font-size:clamp(28px,3.4vw,38px); margin-top:14px;} .section-head p{color:var(--ink-soft); margin-top:14px; font-size:16px;} / ===== About ===== / .about-grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:60px; align-items:start;} @media (max-width:860px){.about-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}} < truncated lines 189-415 > <div class="product-card featured"> <div class="product-head"> <h3>NISOGEZE — Mkopo wa Simu</h3> <span class="tag">Bidhaa Kuu</span> </div> <p class="desc">Mkopo wa kidijitali unaopatikana moja kwa moja kupitia simu yako, ulioundwa kwa ajili ya mahitaji ya haraka ya kila siku na uendeshaji wa biashara ndogo.</p> <table class="ledger-table"> <tr><td>Kiasi cha mkopo</td><td>TZS 50,000 – 2,000,000</td></tr> <tr><td>Muda wa malipo</td><td>Siku 30 – 180*</td></tr> <tr><td>Riba</td><td>Kuanzia XX%</td></tr> <tr><td>Muda wa maamuzi</td><td>Ndani ya saa 24</td></tr> <tr><td>Vitakiwavyo</td><td>Kitambulisho, namba ya simu, historia ya matumizi</td></tr> </table> </div> <div class="product-card"> <div class="product-head"> <h3>Mikopo ya Biashara Ndogo (SME)</h3> <span class="tag">Kwa Wafanyabiashara</span> </div> <p class="desc">Mtaji wa kuendesha au kukuza biashara yako — kutoka duka la rejareja hadi shughuli za kilimo na usafirishaji.</p> <table class="ledger-table"> <tr><td>Kiasi cha mkopo</td><td>TZS 500,000 – 10,000,000*</td></tr> <tr><td>Muda wa malipo</td><td>Miezi 3 – 24*</td></tr> <tr><td>Riba</td><td>Kuanzia XX%</td></tr> <tr><td>Vitakiwavyo</td><td>Uthibitisho wa biashara, dhamana (inapohitajika)</td></tr> </table> </div> </div> </section> <!-- HOW TO APPLY --> <section id="jinsi"> <div class="wrap"> <div class="section-head"> <p class="eyebrow">Jinsi ya Kuomba</p> <h2>Hatua nne hadi kupata mkopo wako.</h2> </div> <div class="steps"> <div class="step"> <span class="n">01</span> <h4>Wasiliana Nasi</h4> <p>Jaza fomu ya mawasiliano hapa chini au piga simu ofisi yetu ili kuanzisha maombi.</p> </div> <div class="step"> <span class="n">02</span> <h4>Wasilisha Nyaraka</h4> <p>Toa taarifa na nyaraka zinazohitajika kulingana na aina ya mkopo unaoomba.</p> </div> <div class="step"> <span class="n">03</span> <h4>Uchambuzi</h4> <p>Afisa wa Mikopo anakagua maombi yako na kukujulisha uamuzi ndani ya muda mfupi.</p> </div> <div class="step"> <span class="n">04</span> <h4>Malipo</h4> <p>Mkopo ulioidhinishwa unatumwa moja kwa moja kwenye akaunti au simu yako.</p> </div> </div> </div> </section> <!-- FAQ --> <section id="maswali" style="background:var(--paper-2);"> <div class="wrap" style="max-width:820px;"> <div class="section-head" style="max-width:100%;"> <p class="eyebrow">Maswali Yanayoulizwa Mara kwa Mara</p> <h2>Una swali? Labda tayari lina jibu hapa.</h2> </div> <details class="faq-item" open> <summary>Ni nani anayeweza kuomba mkopo wa NISOGEZE? <span class="plus">+</span></summary> <p>Mtanzania mzima mwenye kitambulisho halali na namba ya simu iliyosajiliwa anaweza kuomba, kulingana na vigezo vya kustahili vitakavyowekwa na DCL.</p> </details> <details class="faq-item"> <summary>Inachukua muda gani kupata majibu ya maombi? <span class="plus">+</span></summary> <p>Kwa kawaida maamuzi ya awali hutolewa ndani ya masaa machache hadi siku moja ya kazi, kutegemea ukamilifu wa taarifa zilizowasilishwa.</p> </details> <details class="faq-item"> <summary>Je, kuna adhabu kwa kuchelewa kulipa? <span class="plus">+</span></summary> <p>Ndiyo, masharti ya adhabu na urejeshaji yanaelezwa wazi kwenye mkataba wa mkopo kabla ya kusaini. Wasiliana na Afisa wako wa Mikopo kwa maelezo zaidi.</p> </details> <details class="faq-item"> <summary>Naweza kuomba mkopo bila kuja ofisini? <span class="plus">+</span></summary> <p>Bidhaa zetu za kidijitali kama NISOGEZE zimeundwa kuwezesha maombi kwa njia ya simu. Baadhi ya bidhaa (kama mikopo ya SME) zinaweza kuhitaji uthibitisho wa ziada ofisini.</p> </details> </div> </section> <!-- CONTACT --> <section id="wasiliana" class="contact-section"> <div class="wrap"> <div class="section-head"> <p class="eyebrow">Mawasiliano</p> <h2>Tuko tayari kukusaidia.</h2> <p>Wasiliana nasi kwa njia yoyote iliyo rahisi kwako — timu yetu itakujibu haraka.</p> </div> <div class="contact-grid"> <ul class="contact-list"> <li> <span class="ic">&#9742;</span> <div><h4>Simu</h4><a href="tel:+255XXXXXXXXX">+255 XXX XXX XXX</a></div> </li> <li> <span class="ic">&#9993;</span> <div><h4>Barua Pepe</h4><a href="mailto:info@digipesacredit.co.tz">info@digipesacredit.co.tz*</a></div> </li> <li> <span class="ic">&#9679;</span> <div><h4>Ofisi</h4><p>[Mtaa/Jengo], Dar es Salaam, Tanzania*</p></div> </li> <li> <span class="ic">&#128337;</span> <div><h4>Muda wa Kazi</h4><p>Jumatatu – Ijumaa, 08:30 – 17:00*</p></div> </li> </ul> <form class="contact-form" id="contactForm"> <div> <label for="jina">Jina Kamili</label> <input id="jina" name="jina" type="text" placeholder="Andika jina lako" required> </div> <div> <label for="simu">Namba ya Simu</label> <input id="simu" name="simu" type="tel" placeholder="07XX XXX XXX" required> </div> <div> <label for="huduma-select">Unahitaji Huduma Gani?</label> <select id="huduma-select" name="huduma"> <option>NISOGEZE — Mkopo wa Simu</option> <option>Mkopo wa Biashara (SME)</option> <option>Taarifa Tu</option> </select> </div> <div> <label for="ujumbe">Ujumbe</label> <textarea id="ujumbe" name="ujumbe" placeholder="Eleza kwa ufupi unachohitaji..."></textarea> </div> <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Tuma Ujumbe</button> <p class="form-note">* Fomu hii ni ya muundo (front-end) tu — inahitaji kuunganishwa na barua pepe au database halisi na Timu ya IT kabla ya kutumika rasmi.</p> <p id="formStatus" role="status"></p> </form> </div> </div> </section> </main> <footer> <div class="wrap footer-inner"> <span class="fbrand">DigiPesa Credit Limited</span> <div class="footer-links"> <a href="#kuhusu">Kuhusu Sisi</a> <a href="#huduma">Huduma</a> <a href="#wasiliana">Mawasiliano</a> </div> <span>&copy; 2026 DCL. Haki zote zimehifadhiwa.</span> </div> <div class="disclosure"> * Sehemu zenye alama hii ni maudhui ya mfano (placeholder) — nambari za simu, barua pepe, anwani, riba, na tarehe ya kuanzishwa zinahitaji kubadilishwa na takwimu halisi za DCL kabla ya tovuti kuchapishwa rasmi. Kumbuka pia kuongeza taarifa za usimamizi wa kisheria (leseni/regulator) zinazotakiwa kwa taasisi za fedha ndogo Tanzania. </div> </footer> <script> const menuBtn = document.getElementById('menuBtn'); const navLinks = document.getElementById('navLinks'); menuBtn.addEventListener('click', () => { const isOpen = navLinks.classList.toggle('open'); menuBtn.setAttribute('aria-expanded', isOpen); }); navLinks.querySelectorAll('a').forEach(a => a.addEventListener('click', () => { navLinks.classList.remove('open'); menuBtn.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false'); })); const form = document.getElementById('contactForm'); const status = document.getElementById('formStatus'); form.addEventListener('submit', (e) => { e.preventDefault(); status.textContent = 'Asante! (Onyesho tu — unganisha fomu hii na mfumo halisi wa DCL.)'; form.reset(); }); </script> </body> </html>
